            {
              "detail": 0,
              "format": 0,
              "mode": "normal",
              "style": "",
              "text": "This moisturizer boasts a rich and delicate texture, as well as a long hydration of the epidermis, which strengthens and protects the skin barrier making it soft and silky. The natural active ingredients of Marigold, Chamomile, Achillea, and Ruscus perform a repairing action of the damaged tissue, thanks to their properties that can soothe irritation and redness. The Mallow, plant rich in mucilage, gives the skin a particular softness, and is indicated as protection from external agents. The extraordinary emollient and nourishing action of this moisturizer is due to the presence of the Tuscan extra virgin olive oil produced according to the principles of biodynamic and certified by Demeter. The polyglycerols of olive oil – a combination of glycerols and fatty acids – are new generation PEG free emulsifiers and have the ability to retain water in cosmetics, thus reducing the use of preservatives. To complete the formulation we have jojoba oils, wheat germ, and almonds, rich in carbohydrates, proteins, minerals, enzymes, vitamins, and monounsaturated fats, including oleic acid, linoleic, palmitic, and stearic. ",
              "type": "text",
              "version": 1
            }
